<title>SPAIN: Spanish retail sales rise 0.92 pct yr/yr in Nov.</title>
<headline>Spanish retail sales rise 0.92 pct yr/yr in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish retail sales data for November, according to the National Statistics Institute INE.</p>
<p>			     Mth/Mth change  Yr/Yr change General</p>
<p>index			   -7.20 pct	0.92 pct</p>
<p> Food			   -4.90 pct     -0.74 pct</p>
<p> Personal goods	     -7.77 pct	4.10 pct</p>
<p> Household goods	    -4.20 pct	1.85 pct</p>
<p> Other consumer goods    -15.58 pct	0.66 pct</p>
</text>
